{"id": "1808707", "name": "אינטגרל מוכלל – פרמטר בחזקת x", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "arccos", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "f", "params": ["x", "a"], "body": "(c1*x^n+c2*x^a)/(x^m+c3)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q10_IMPROPER_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">מצאו עבור אילו ערכים של הפרמטר a האינטגרל מתכנס</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.9;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\int_{1}^{\\infty} {{CT:0}}\\,dx\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">התשובה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 8px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 8px;\">אפשר להשתמש ב־<strong>and</strong>, <strong>or</strong>, <strong>&gt;</strong>, <strong>&gt;=</strong>, <strong>&lt;</strong>, <strong>&lt;=</strong>.</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q10_IMPROPER_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>במכנה האיבר המוביל הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x^{{CT:1}}\\)</span>. האיבר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x^{{CT:2}}\\)</span> במונה תמיד יוצר חזקה אינטגרבילית, משום ש־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:1}}-{{CT:2}}\\ge 2\\)</span>.</p>\n<p>לכן האילוץ היחיד מגיע מן האיבר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x^a\\)</span>:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle x^{a-{{CT:1}}}\\)</div>\n<p>אינטגרל חזקה על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle [1,\\infty)\\)</span> מתכנס אם ורק אם המעריך קטן מ־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle -1\\)</span>, ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle a-{{CT:1}}&lt;-1\\iff a&lt;{{CT:3}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "למשל: a>3/2", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "result", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["c1", "c2", "c3", "gap", "m", "n", "result", "threshold"], "nvariants": 50}